OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to murdering
OL,4,Awoman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering a
OL,7,F24-year-old woman in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,9,FKyle Pala, 30, is accused over the
OL,10,Fdeath of Sarah-Louise Pennington whose
OL,11,Fbody was discovered by police in the
OL,12,Fearly hours of 12 July at an address in
OL,13,FLongton.
OL,15,FPala, of Oakwell Grove, Longton,
OL,16,Fappeared at Stoke-on-Trent Crown Court
OL,17,Fon Monday.
OL,19,FWearing a grey polo shirt, a dark Nike
OL,20,Fjacket and blue jeans, he spoke only to
OL,21,Fconfirm his name and to enter a plea of
OL,22,Fnot guilty.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
